sequenceDiagram
  participant Portal
  participant Booking as booking-service
  participant Customs as customs-docs
  participant Broker as ClearPath Broker
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant Tracking as tracking-worker
  Portal->>Booking: POST /v1/bookings
  Booking->>Booking: RatingService.quote (lane_tariff)
  Booking->>Customs: POST /v1/declarations (GB<->EU only)
  Customs->>Broker: POST /v3/declarations
  Booking->>MQ: booking.confirmed.v1
  Booking->>Booking: DispatchService.schedule
  Booking->>MQ: booking.dispatched.v1
  MQ->>Tracking: tracking.booking-dispatched
  Tracking->>MQ: tracking.eta-updated.v1
